; PLACEHOLDER values, easy to retune here. Rationale: the wave is a safe-distance tool, so every
; tier's sustained damage per second (damage / max(cooldown, startup + recovery)) stays BELOW the
; sword's (1 / 0.45 = 2.22 dps): tier 0 = 1.00, tier 1 = 1.11, tier 2 = 1.67 dps. Higher tiers
; mostly add reach, width and piercing instead of raw damage.

